# The Worldgorger Dragon loop broken by floating mana (CR 106.4): Bot1 holds Withering Torment ({2}{B}), which its two
# Swamps can't pay for at once - so it is never offered at priority - but the Swamps come back untapped each time round the
# loop and mana stays in the pool until the step ends. A loop every player only passes in is let go round and is then a
# draw (docs/rules-exceptions.md, RX-4), and tapping the Swamps is an action that ends that run of passes. Bot1 lets the
# loop go round without tapping them for seventeen passes (its twentieth priority would be the draw), then taps them
# two times round in a row, floating four black mana, and with the Dragon's third enters ability on the stack casts
# Withering Torment on the Dragon: Bot1 loses 2 life, the Dragon's leaves ability returns nothing (nothing is exiled with
# it yet), Animate Dead goes to the graveyard enchanting nothing (CR 704.5m), and the enters ability then exiles both
# Swamps for good. One black mana is left floating.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Entomb
Animate Dead
Withering Torment
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Worldgorger Dragon
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Worldgorger Dragon)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Animate Dead.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Worldgorger Dragon)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Result = InProgress
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = {B}{B}{B}{B}
? Stack = Worldgorger Dragon
Bot1.Hand.Withering Torment.Cast(Worldgorger Dragon)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Result = InProgress
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
Exile = Swamp; Swamp
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 4
Bot1.Life = 18
